//! The `mask-composite` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property represents
//! a compositing operation used on the current mask layer with the mask layers below it.
//!
//! Initial: add. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <compositing-operator>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-masking-1/#propdef-mask-composite
//!
//! Author guide:
